meta {
  name: Mark As Read
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{notificationsBaseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationGuid}}/read
  body: none
  auth: none
}

vars:pre-request {
  notificationGuid: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

docs {
  Marks one notification read. Call this when the user clicks an item, before
  routing them to the target page.

  Set `notificationGuid` from a List Notifications response.

  Success (200): `data` is the caller's remaining unread count, so the bell can
  be updated from an authoritative number without a second round trip.

  Failure: 404 `not_found` — the notification does not exist, is already read,
  or belongs to another user. Ownership is enforced in the query itself, so a
  guessed GUID cannot be read or mutated by anyone else.
}
